OHOS: keep the recording-export entry point, the OHOS-specific
`filesDir`-based OCR resource path, and the existing policy of disabling the
system tray and showing the main window instead. Drop shortcut/startup trace
logging, a tray-polling code path that cannot be reached on OHOS (and its
dedicated header), and a duplicate assignment of the OCR bundled-runtime
root.

